{"id":"4ba26c584396bfa5","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-order10-dense-order-embedding.md","title":"ZFC Order10 Dense Order Embedding","display":"df-zfc-order10-dense-order-embedding — ZFC Order10 Dense Order Embedding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order10-dense-order-embedding","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order10-dense-order-embedding"],"display":"df-zfc-order10-dense-order-embedding — ZFC Order10 Dense Order Embedding","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-total-order.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-order10-order-embedding.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order10-dense-order-embedding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order10-dense-order-embedding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order10-dense-order-embedding — ZFC Order10 Dense Order Embedding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"043908345fb04de3\" href=\"?note=043908345fb04de3\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-total-order.md\">../batch20/58-df-total-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"66fcb1175fb50214\" href=\"?note=66fcb1175fb50214\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-order10-order-embedding.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-order10-order-embedding.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q,&lt;_{P},&lt;_{Q},f\\in V\">\\(P,Q,&lt;_{P},&lt;_{Q},f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(P,&lt;_{P})\">\\(\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(P,&lt;_{P})\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(Q,&lt;_{Q})\">\\(\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(Q,&lt;_{Q})\\)</span> (total-order predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10OrderEmbedding}_S(f,P,&lt;_{P},Q,&lt;_{Q})\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10OrderEmbedding}_S(f,P,&lt;_{P},Q,&lt;_{Q})\\)</span> (order-embedding predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10DenseOrderEmbedding}_S(f,P,&lt;_{P},Q,&lt;_{Q})\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10DenseOrderEmbedding}_S(f,P,&lt;_{P},Q,&lt;_{Q})\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}dense\\text{-}order\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder10DenseOrderEmbedding}_S(f,P,&lt;_{P},Q,&lt;_{Q})\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TotalOrder}(P,&lt;_{P})\\land\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(Q,&lt;_{Q})\\land\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10OrderEmbedding}_S(f,P,&lt;_{P},Q,&lt;_{Q})\\land\\forall q_0,q_1\\in Q\\;\\bigl(q_0&lt;_{Q}q_1\\to\\exists p\\in P\\;(q_0&lt;_{Q}f(p)&lt;_{Q}q_1)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}dense\\text{-}order\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder10DenseOrderEmbedding}_S(f,P,&lt;_{P},Q,&lt;_{Q})\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TotalOrder}(P,&lt;_{P})\\land\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(Q,&lt;_{Q})\\land\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10OrderEmbedding}_S(f,P,&lt;_{P},Q,&lt;_{Q})\\land\\forall q_0,q_1\\in Q\\;\\bigl(q_0&lt;_{Q}q_1\\to\\exists p\\in P\\;(q_0&lt;_{Q}f(p)&lt;_{Q}q_1)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>“Dense” here means order-dense image: between any two distinct comparable points of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> lies a point of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f[P]\">\\(f[P]\\)</span>. The former final conjunct expressed downward cofinality in a forcing order, not density of an ordered embedding.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-total-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"043908345fb04de3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-total-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-order10-order-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"66fcb1175fb50214","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-order10-order-embedding.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,Q,<_{P},<_{Q},f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(P,<_{P})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(Q,<_{Q})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10OrderEmbedding}_S(f,P,<_{P},Q,<_{Q})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10DenseOrderEmbedding}_S(f,P,<_{P},Q,<_{Q})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}dense\\text{-}order\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder10DenseOrderEmbedding}_S(f,P,<_{P},Q,<_{Q})\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TotalOrder}(P,<_{P})\\land\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(Q,<_{Q})\\land\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10OrderEmbedding}_S(f,P,<_{P},Q,<_{Q})\\land\\forall q_0,q_1\\in Q\\;\\bigl(q_0<_{Q}q_1\\to\\exists p\\in P\\;(q_0<_{Q}f(p)<_{Q}q_1)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"f[P]","display":false}],"bytes":1414,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2859","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-order10-dense-order-embedding.md|58-df-zfc-order10-dense-order-embedding]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["043908345fb04de3","66fcb1175fb50214"]}